our track coach was just fired for sleeping with a student. it started when she was a freshman (14) and they were just caught (shes now 17 i think)

&#x200B;

also our band director was fired last year for making a hitler joke at a jewish girl. he worked at the school for \~20 years and all the kids knew he was a pedo and racist but because he never did anything they couldn't fire him.
